{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le08ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le08ob03re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le08ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell me more about feeling young, innocent and free.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">George</span>: Well, back in those days, our idea of a good time was drinking cola, collecting baseball cards and illegally jumping into the river. We were carefree - we didn't have e-mails to write, texts to read or statuses to \u201clike\u201d.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "We were so excited when a new 45 came out! We would drop by Teddy's house every Friday afternoon - he had a record player in his rec room. My sister used to work at Woolworth's and she would give us the heads up when a new single was coming out. I've collected so many records - I should see how much money my collection is worth - it's probably very surprising.", "id": 2, "time": "25500"}, {"image": "engenn7le08ob03re2img03.jpg", "text": "Anyway, it's disappointing to see how different it is for kids these days ... but that's what every older generation says, isn't it? We like to believe that the way things were for us is superior to the way things are now. Since my grandkids came along, I've seen how smart and adaptable they are to new technology - it's amazing!", "id": 3, "time": "56000"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "static", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "img", "value": "engenn7le08ob03re5img01.jpg"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about feelings and reac